### Book an appointment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 1, "doctor_id": 2, "appt_datetime": "2027-01-20 10:00"}
### Cancel appointment 18
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/18/cancel
### Doctor stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/1/stats

### Doctors report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/doctors

### Busy days report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/busy-days